	"Description": "[font=Tahoma]A content pack for[color=#e69138][b] [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternative Textures[/url][/b][/color] recolouring the Standing Geode to support all your aesthetic needs &lt;3\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Credits for the geode colours go entirely to the wonderful\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/HeadInTheCloudsModding/mods]HeadInTheCloudsModding[/url]\uFEFF from xer tilesheets! (to be linked here). I just added in the stands and turned it into an AT pack.\n<br />\n<br />[/font][font=Tahoma]FILES INCLUDED:\n<br />[/font][list]\n<br />[*][font=Tahoma]An All-In-One version including all 84 colour combinations![/font]\n<br />[*][font=Tahoma]Separate versions per rock colour in the optional files, so you can mix and match to your liking.[/font]\n<br />[/list][font=Tahoma]\n<br />[/font][font=Tahoma]Installation Instructions:\n<br />\n<br />Download and install the latest version of SMAPI and any requirements listed.\n<br />Download and unzip my mod into your Stardew Valley&#92;Mods&#92; folder\n<br />That's all! :)\n<br />\n<br />If you're new to Alternative Textures:\n<br />\n<br />Just go to Robin's house and purchase the Paint Bucket item from AT in her shop. While equipping it, click on the Standing Geode while it's out and pick whichever colour you want.[/font]",
